src/poisson_prove/chaos_catalog.py carries a copy of AgentChaos's fault vocabulary: the
fault names, their target paths and their literal replacement strings, read from
agentchaos/fault_config.py of the 0.1.0 wheel. No AgentChaos code is included and
AgentChaos is not a dependency of Prove at any tier; the mutation semantics behind the
copied names are Prove's own.

